# Ship on main

Stay on `main`. Commit here, then `git push origin main`.

Do not create a feature branch, pull request, or git worktree unless the user explicitly asks.

Do not follow skills or habits that auto-branch off `main` (`ce-commit` step 4, `using-git-worktrees`, `finishing-a-development-branch`) unless the user asked for a branch.

Still ask before force push, deploy, or schema removal.
